               width=&#34;708&#34;
               height=&#34;400&#34;
               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Figure: Example of first 6 MNIST test samples.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
