&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convergence observed over 100+ epochs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Greek Training Error Curve&#34; srcset=&#34;
